---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Matchmaking | Northeastern Student Event"
  description="An independent student-run matchmaking event for Northeastern undergraduate students. Answer a few questions, get manually matched, and meet in person at an off-campus reveal night."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>
        Meet someone matched for you.
      </h1>
      
      <p>
        A student-run matchmaking event for Northeastern undergraduate students. Answer a few questions, get manually matched, and meet in person at our cozy off-campus reveal night.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <a href="#apply" class="btn btn-primary btn-fit">
          Apply for the next event
        </a>
        <span class="cta-helper-text">Free to apply &bull; $25 ticket only if matched</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image-container">
      <img 
        src="/images/hero_campus_social.png" 
        alt="College students sitting around a table laughing at a warm social gathering" 
        class="image-card hero-image"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
        width="430"
        height="322"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works Section -->
  <section id="how-it-works">
    <h2 class="section-tag">How it works</h2>
    
    <ol class="steps-list">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <li class="step-card">
        <div class="step-main">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3 class="step-title">Apply</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">
              Answer a few questions about your music taste, your typical Sunday, what makes you laugh, and what you value. It takes about 4 minutes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-container">
          <img 
            src="/images/step_apply.png" 
            alt="Hand writing in a notebook next to a warm cup of coffee on a wooden desk" 
            class="image-card step-image"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="150"
            height="110"
          />
        </div>
      </li>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <li class="step-card step-reverse">
        <div class="step-main">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3 class="step-title">Get matched</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">
              We read every single application manually. No black-box algorithms or endless swiping. Your answers are kept strictly confidential—we match you based on real compatibility, never for gossip.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-container">
          <img 
            src="/images/step_match.png" 
            alt="Two warm Polaroid photos sitting on a table showing happy couples" 
            class="image-card step-image"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="150"
            height="110"
          />
        </div>
      </li>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <li class="step-card">
        <div class="step-main">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3 class="step-title">Come to the event</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">
              Pay the $25 fee only if matched. The ticket covers your entry, first drink, and our no-show backup guarantee to ensure you're never left hanging.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-image-container">
          <img 
            src="/images/step_event.png" 
            alt="Two people laughing and clinking their drinks together in a cozy cafe" 
            class="image-card step-image"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="150"
            height="110"
          />
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust & Details Section -->
  <section id="details">
    <h2 class="section-tag">The Details</h2>
    
    <div class="details-split">
      <div class="details-box">
        <div class="details-grid">
          <div class="details-item">
            <!-- User / Student SVG Icon -->
            <svg class="details-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="details-text">
              <strong>Student-run & independent.</strong> We're Northeastern students who got tired of standard dating apps and wanted a better, more human way to meet people. We're not affiliated with the university.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details-item">
            <!-- Heart / Hand-crafted SVG Icon -->
            <svg class="details-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="details-text">
              <strong>Strictly private matching.</strong> We read every response ourselves to look for real compatibility and shared vibes. Your detailed questionnaire answers are viewed only by the matching team and cleared after the event.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details-item">
            <!-- Map Pin SVG Icon -->
            <svg class="details-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="details-text">
              <strong>Off-campus reveal night.</strong> Hosted at a cozy, off-campus social space. It's a casual evening where matches are revealed—no formal pressure, just good music and conversations.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="details-image-container">
        <img 
          src="/images/reveal_venue.png" 
          alt="Cozy off-campus lounge with leather armchairs, green plants, and warm lighting" 
          class="image-card details-venue-image"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          width="320"
          height="240"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Application Embed Section -->
  <section id="apply" class="form-section">
    <div class="form-header">
      <h2>Apply for the next drop</h2>
      
      <div class="pricing-disclosure">
        <strong>Transparent Pricing & Accountability:</strong> Applying is 100% free. You only pay the $25 attendance fee if we find you a compatible match. Because matches are paired 1:1, we enforce a strict accountability policy to prevent no-shows.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Empty container placeholder for Tally.so embed -->
    <div class="embed-placeholder">
      <svg class="placeholder-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/>
        <path d="M12 8v8"/>
        <path d="M8 12h8"/>
      </svg>
      <p class="embed-placeholder-title">Tally.so Form Embed</p>
      <p class="embed-placeholder-desc">
        This container is currently empty. You can paste your Tally.so or Typeform iframe/embed code here when you're ready.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="#" id="fallback-apply-btn" class="btn btn-secondary">
      Open application in new tab
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section id="faq">
    <h2 class="section-tag">FAQ</h2>
    
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Who is this for?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Any Northeastern undergraduate student looking for a genuine romantic connection. We match people of all genders and sexual orientations. Please note that this event is strictly for undergraduate students; graduate students are not eligible to apply.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How is my privacy protected?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          We take privacy very seriously. Because we are independent student organizers, we know confidentiality is everything. Your questionnaire is reviewed only by our matching team under strict confidentiality. Your answers are never shared publicly or with other students, and all detailed questionnaire responses are cleared from our matching sheets after the event.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How much does it cost and what is included?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Applying is 100% free. If we find you a compatible match, the ticket to secure your spot is $25. This covers hosting costs, your first drink/refreshment, and our no-show safety guarantee. We run this completely at-cost to keep it high-quality and student-friendly.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What happens if my match doesn't show up?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          To protect the experience, we enforce a zero-no-show policy. Everyone must confirm attendance 24 hours prior. If a match flakes without notifying us, they are permanently blacklisted from all future events. In the rare case of a no-show, we will fully refund your $25 ticket or pair you with one of our backup matches/hosts on site so you still have a great night.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What if I don't get matched?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          We prioritize compatibility over random pairings, so we cannot guarantee a match for everyone. If we don't find a strong match for you, you won't pay anything, and you'll receive priority matching in our next event drop.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What kind of questions do you ask?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Nice try. Take the quiz and find out. 😉
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Where is the event?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          The reveal night is hosted at a warm, welcoming off-campus space near campus. The exact location is kept private and will be shared only with selected matches.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA Section -->
  <section id="final-cta">
    <h2>Ready to find your match?</h2>
    <p>
      Take 4 minutes to fill out the questionnaire. The next matchmaking drop is happening soon.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-container">
      <a href="#apply" class="btn btn-primary btn-fit">
        Apply for the next event
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
